se; tag it [non-codebase] — prefix the checkbox text with [non-codebase] so the completion verifier accepts a recorded attestation instead of failing to find code proof."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc801a522e3","priority":0.4,"reason":null,"recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Split compound criteria, replace subjective terms with observable outcomes, and state how each is verified.","tier":"DET","validity":1.0,"verification":null},{"block_threshold":null,"blocking_enabled":null,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P9"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":null,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["file_impact is empty"],"finding":"No file_impact declared on a leaf work ticket.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2b56a0701da43def","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"n6324407e6516f811","priority":0.4,"reason":null,"recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Record the {path, reason} files this work will touch (e.g. via set_file_impact) so the attestation is scoped to them.","tier":"DET","validity":1.0,"verification":null},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add an explicit value_wo / write-only-secret guard to the Verification and stop-condition mechanism (e.g. confirm every migrated `rebar_secrets` param's `value_wo_version` is unchanged from state and no create/first-write is scheduled for a live-seeded secret, or scope the apply to exclude the value_wo migration) — the plan-diff envelope alone cannot detect a CHANGEME overwrite of the 21 prod SecureStrings.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.6,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["ssm.tf:104-105: `value_wo = \"CHANGEME\"` / `value_wo_version = 1` on `aws_ssm_parameter.rebar_secrets`; comment (ssm.tf:100-103): 'value_wo is NEVER persisted to terraform state. The provider sends it on create and whenever value_wo_version changes'","Ticket comment 1788044999: 'a clean apply here now shares the SAME physical apply as the value_wo migration on origin/main:ssm.tf, which would overwrite all 21 prod SecureString secrets with the CHANGEME placeholder (write-only arg, invisible in the plan diff) -> prod auth/signing/reconcile outage'","Plan Verification: gate is defined purely as plan-count/diff match ('the two observability alarm creates ... 0 destroys, 0 replacements'); a value_wo push does not surface as add/change/destroy, so the stated stop condition never fires on it","ABSENCE: the plan text never mentions value_wo, ADR 0105, or the 21-SecureString overwrite risk"],"finding":"The plan's verification/stop-condition mechanism (match the terraform plan add/change/destroy envelope; stop on any destroy/replace/non-no-op) cannot detect the write-only `value_wo` secret-overwrite hazard that this ticket's own comments flag as a prod-outage risk, because a write-only value push is invisible in the plan diff by design.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f17785b6a86ed367f","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Verification section + Operator Approval and Scope + Current Fresh-Plan Envelope","norm_id":"n4c14f724227085a6","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Operator runs the approved apply; the plan shows the exact 6-add/1-change/0-destroy envelope and passes every stated gate, yet the same apply silently pushes value_wo=CHANGEME across all migrated SecureString secrets, taking down prod auth/signing/reconcile","The plan's stop-without-mutation clause does not engage because the diff matches the approved envelope"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Before apply, assert via `terraform state show` / plan JSON that no `aws_ssm_parameter.rebar_secrets` entry is scheduled for a first write (create) or a `value_wo_version` bump